'''Grand Emperor Warumongar''' (超極悪大帝ワルモーン, ''Chōgokuaku Daitē Warumōn'', '''Super Malevolent Great Emperor Warumon''') is a [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Emperor Warumongar]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

